{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20250221\/20250221084748_43594.png","category_id":"6a157626b0cd2e35d86fcf74","column_id":"6a154fc77093015d5705df9a","create_time":"2025-02-21 08:46:07","details":"<p>\r\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20250221\/20250221084906_44326.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"250\" =\"\" align=\"\" \/> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\tmPEG-SVA（甲氧基聚乙二醇琥珀酰亚胺戊酸酯）是一种功能化的聚乙二醇（PEG）衍生物，以下是对其官能团的详细介绍：\r\n<\/p>\r\n<h3>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<h3>\r\n\t官能团特性与应用\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t高度反应性：琥珀酰亚胺活性酯基团的存在使得mPEG-SVA能够与多种含有氨基的生物分子（如蛋白质、抗体、肽、核酸等）进行偶联，形成共价键。这种偶联反应在生物医药领域具有广泛的应用，如药物递送系统、生物分子偶联、抗体标记与靶向治疗等。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t改善生物相容性和稳定性：通过与生物分子偶联，mPEG-SVA能够显著改善这些分子的生物相容性和稳定性，减少免疫反应，提高药物的疗效和安全性。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t细胞成像与生物传感器应用：mPEG-SVA的高分子结构和官能团特性还使其在细胞成像和生物传感器领域具有潜在的应用价值。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t作为合成前体：此外，mPEG-SVA还可以作为合成其他功能材料的前体，如mPEG-PLA等，进一步拓宽了其应用范围。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>产品技术优势<\/strong><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \">赛诺邦格提供高质量PEG衍生物，具有产品结构新颖多样，取代基团丰富，端基取代率高等特点。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \"><br \/>\r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<ul font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \">\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t高PEG官能团含量-含量可高达99%\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t\t<\/ul>\r\n<blockquote font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \">\r\n\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\tPEG的官能化，是PEG产品中最有难度的。市场上主要产品存在的普遍问题是官能团含量不高。而我们掌握的修饰技术、引发体系、非常规沉淀法和系统萃取法等技术和工艺可以轻松制得高官能团含量的产品。大部分产品的官能团含量可达99%，比对手的90%左右高得多。\r\n\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/blockquote>\r\n<p font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \"><br \/>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n<ul font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \">\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t高质量PEG分子量控制-PDI &lt;1.05\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\r\n<blockquote font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t聚合物的单分子链通常来说是由许多小分子重复单元通过聚合的方法连接而得。合成方法的设计和控制对实现单个高分子链段的长度，以及多个聚合物链段的长度相似程度有至关重要的影响。我们的PEG合成技术能保证非常好的分散度（PDI&lt;1.05)，而许多其他 公司的产品一般PDI仅在1.1左右。\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<br \/>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/blockquote>\r\n<h3 class=\"Editable-styled\" background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; list-style-type: none; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \"><span>相关推荐：<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\r\n<div class=\"TableToolbar-container\" font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: i